  "cueList": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.9199998,
      "text": "A PEN by Ella Wheeler Wilcox",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.9199998,
      "end": 7.72,
      "text": "Read for LibriVox.org by Brusca Chuck",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 7.72,
      "end": 13.36,
      "text": "Oh, I know a certain lady who is reckoned with the good,",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 13.799999,
      "end": 17.68,
      "text": "Yet she fills me with more terror than a raging lion would.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 18.22,
      "end": 21.96,
      "text": "The little chills run up and down my spine whene'er we meet,",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 22.4,
      "end": 26.859999,
      "text": "Though she seems a gentle creature, and she's very trim and neat,",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 26.859999,
      "end": 31.199999,
      "text": "And she has a thousand virtues, and not one acknowledged sin.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 31.56,
      "end": 35.5,
      "text": "But she is the sort of person you could liken to a pin.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 36.14,
      "end": 40.719997,
      "text": "And she pricks you, and she sticks you, in a way that can't be said.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 41.179996,
      "end": 46.219997,
      "text": "If you seek for what has hurt you, why, you cannot find the head.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 46.98,
      "end": 51.079998,
      "text": "But she fills you with discomfort and exasperating pain.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 51.48,
      "end": 55.16,
      "text": "If anybody asks you why, you really can't explain.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 55.16,
      "end": 60,
      "text": "A pin is such a tiny thing, of that there is no doubt.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 60,
      "end": 64.94,
      "text": "Yet when it's sticking in your flesh, you're wretched till it's out.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 65.83999969999999,
      "end": 67.6,
      "text": "She is wonderfully observing.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 67.94,
      "end": 71.74,
      "text": "When she meets a pretty girl, she is always sure to tell her,",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 71.96000000000001,
      "end": 77.859999,
      "text": "If her hair is out of curl, and she is so sympathetic to her friend who's much admired.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 78.24,
      "end": 83.039999,
      "text": "She is often heard remarking, Dear, you look so worn and tired.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 83.74,
      "end": 89.439999,
      "text": "And she is an honest critic, for on yesterday she eyed the new dress I was airing,",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 89.439999,
      "end": 91.56,
      "text": "with a woman's natural pride.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 91.91999799999999,
      "end": 92.78,
      "text": "And she said,",
      "check": false
    }
  ],
